e had been  casting for a year and a half we had  seen over 500 young people of which  trans girls boys and girls and the very  challenging thing for this part was that  you needed to be 15 dance on the level  that you can dance a choreography of  Sydney Leroux Sharkey which is not easy  act carry a feature film and will  present his identity in a way that it is  complex you know that people will be  looking at that and so we didn't find  all those things in one person and that  was very difficult for us and then all  of a sudden we started casting the  secondary roles because we didn't know  how to continue with the main role and  Victor applied for one of the other  dancers in the film and when he came my  whole team we were looking at each other  because we were like wait it's like a  scene from a movie yeah exactly and we  have felt this immediate attraction to  this person by the way he moved by the  way he positioned himself in the group  and you could immediately feel that it  was someone that was very close in a lot  of ways to Nora if you know Nora if you  felt that the similarities and so so  yeah  Belgium is split by language and culture  yeah and you have you reflect that a  little in the cement in the languages  was that important too to get across in  your store  yeah I have in my OMA in all my films  all my short films I have always used an  Flemish and French we live in a country  that is divided by its language barrier  and our industries are divided as well  so we have a Flemish industry and a  French and I just like the idea of  identifying as a Belgian filmmaker  because I like the idea of working  together and I also like the idea that I  can work with people from the and the  French and the Flemish industry but also  it actors from both of them and in this  script in a way it was very handy  because we needed a rupture as the  family moves to another environment we  could also make it in the script a  rupture in language and so for us that  was a way to again integrate and Flemish  and French I think for me and you have  some political parties that want to  separate our country which is a stupid  ID so I think it's important to unify in  those moments please thank Lucas don't
 

